  <!-- === Template written by the debug action === -->
  <!-- EN: # .rimignore — files and folders to exclude when uploading to the Steam Workshop
#
# The syntax is identical to GitHub's .gitignore:
#   #        comment (\# for a literal hash)
#   !xxx     re-include; later rules override earlier ones
#   /xxx     anchored to the mod root
#   xxx/     directories only
#   *        any characters, but never across /
#   ?        a single character, but never across /
#   [abc]    character set; [!abc] to negate
#   **/xxx   at any depth; xxx/** for everything inside that folder
#
# Note: as in Git, once a directory is excluded its contents cannot be
# re-included with !.
# Always excluded by default: this file, .git/ .gitignore .gitattributes
#                             .svn/ .hg/ .vs/ .idea/ .vscode/
#                             Thumbs.db desktop.ini .DS_Store
# Those built-in rules can be overridden with !, e.g. !.rimignore uploads this file too.

# - - Source code and build output - -
/_Sources/
/Source/
**/obj/
**/bin/
*.pdb
*.csproj.user
*.sln
*.suo

# - - Unity project - -
/UnityProject/

# - - Dev tools and shortcuts - -
/_Tools/
*.lnk
*.bat

# - - Editor and backup noise - -
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*~

# - - Example: exclude a folder's contents but keep one file - -
# Exclude the *contents* rather than the folder itself, then re-include:
# /Docs/*
# !/Docs/Manual.md
 -->
  <FFF_RimIgnore_Template># .rimignore — 上傳 Steam 創意工坊時要排除的檔案／資料夾\n#\n# 語法與 GitHub 的 .gitignore 完全相同：\n#   #        註解（\# 可轉義為字面井號）\n#   !xxx     反選（重新納入），後出現的規則覆蓋先出現的規則\n#   /xxx     錨定於模組根目錄\n#   xxx/     僅匹配目錄\n#   *        任意字元（不跨越 /）\n#   ?        單一字元（不跨越 /）\n#   [abc]    字元集，[!abc] 為排除\n#   **/xxx   任意深度；xxx/** 代表該目錄底下全部\n#\n# 注意：與 Git 相同，資料夾一旦被排除，其中的內容就無法再用 ! 重新納入。\n# 內建已自動排除：本檔案、.git/ .gitignore .gitattributes .svn/ .hg/\n#                 .vs/ .idea/ .vscode/ Thumbs.db desktop.ini .DS_Store\n# 這些內建規則同樣可以用 ! 覆寫，例如：!.rimignore 會讓本檔案一起上傳。\n\n# ── 原始碼與建置產物 ──\n/_Sources/\n/Source/\n**/obj/\n**/bin/\n*.pdb\n*.csproj.user\n*.sln\n*.suo\n\n# ── Unity 專案 ──\n/UnityProject/\n\n# ── 開發用工具與捷徑 ──\n/_Tools/\n*.lnk\n*.bat\n\n# ── 編輯器與備份雜訊 ──\n*.orig\n*.rej\n*.bak\n*~\n\n# ── 範例：排除整個資料夾但保留其中一個檔案 ──\n# 先排除「內容」而非資料夾本身，再反選要保留的檔案：\n# /Docs/*\n# !/Docs/Manual.md\n</FFF_RimIgnore_Template>

